   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"2\" type=\"1\">\n    <li>Here is a graph of the function <span data-math=\"f\">f</span> defined by <span data-math=\"f(x)=a \\cdot b^x\">f(x)=a \\cdot b^x</span>.<br> <img alt=\"Graph of function f, a smooth, decreasing curve in the first quadrant. The x and y axes are shown, with the origin at 0.\" height=\"292\" src=\"exercises/media/09d47cba7f6e12dc.jpg\" width=\"300\"><br><strong>Select three</strong> possible values of <span data-math=\"b\">b</span>.</li>\n  </ol>\n  <ol type=\"a\">\n    <li>0</li>\n    <li><span data-math=\"\\frac{1}{10}\">\\frac{1}{10}</span></li>\n    <li><span data-math=\"\\frac12\">\\frac12</span></li>\n    <li><span data-math=\"\\frac{9}{10}\">\\frac{9}{10}</span></li>\n    <li>1</li>\n    <li>1.3</li>\n    <li><span data-math=\"\\frac{18}{5}\">\\frac{18}{5}</span></li>\n  </ol>",
